id: perfection-long-awaited-perfection
name: Long-Awaited Perfection
order: 2
slot: trait
stacks: 2
description: >
  You have become a being of resplendent perfection.
text: >
  Long-Awaited Perfection (2): You have become a being of resplendent perfection.
  (1)-[Passive]: Increase your Maximum Life Points and Maximum Ki Points by 2 for each Power Level reached.
  (2)-[Passive]: Reduce the Critical Target of your Combat Rolls by 1.
  (3)-[Triggered/Start of Turn]: Gain 1 Adaptation Point.
  (4)-[Triggered/Start of Turn, 1/Encounter]: You may spend 3 Adaptation Points to gain 1 Action.

